<title>THAILAND: Furukawa Metal 1996 net profit higher.</title>
<headline>Furukawa Metal 1996 net profit higher.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for</p>
<p>the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>			     Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		  5.86    vs	  3.94</p>
<p>    Net			 206.80    vs	131.84</p>
<p>NOTES:  Company's full name is Furukawa Metal (Thailand) Plc, a producer of seamless copper tubes for cooling machines.</p>
